Package: hifiberry-analog-recognition
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         songrec,
         hifiberry-audiocontrol,
         hifiberry-vu-meter,
         hifiberry-configurator (>= 2.13.18)
Description: HiFiBerry analog input recognition service
 Identifies tracks playing on an analog (e.g. turntable/RIAA) input using
 songrec, and reports accurate play/stop state from the VU-meter service's
 real-time signal level. Publishes both into AudioControl as a generic
 player named "analog".
